WEBVTT

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.300
Good morning, Prince-sama.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.070
Morning.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.920
Hello to you too, goat.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.810
<i>Morning chores complete!</i>

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.980
<i>They still haven't contacted me about my coord,</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>so I suppose they're not done with it yet.</i>

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.670
<i>I can't wait to début!</i>

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:56.490
Huh?

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:02.040
This box Toriko-san gave me makes sounds?

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.420
It's singing!

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.740
Fuwari's coord is done, but she's not picking up her phone.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.470
I'm sure it's because she's ignoring me-tori!

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.970
That's it! Has to be!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.930
That's got to be why!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.890
Fuwari dances! Her first concert!

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:00.170
Have you adjusted to school life yet, Midorikaze-san?

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.120
No, not really.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.790
This goat sure has become a big fan of yours.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.080
Purity.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.960
A place that hasn't been immersed in city life would be good for you.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:13.670
No, I want to get used to the city.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.130
I've found you!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.350
Ack!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:21.560
It's time for your Princess lessons, Midorikaze-san!

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:22.470
Did you forget?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.370
Oh! Already?

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.540
I'm sorry.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.470
Princess lessons?

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:31.800
Hibiki-sama is expecting big things from you.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:38.610
However, it takes more than simply taking first in the PriPara GranPrix to be a Princess.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.860
It takes heart, technique, and physique!

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:48.080
That is to say a real Princess is one who wholeheartedly wishes to achieve the pinnacle of femininity.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:53.290
And in order to master this, Princess lessons are required.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.180
G-Good luck, Fuwari-

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.880
Hold it right there, Manaka-san.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.160
Your shoes!

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.970
Walking on the backstay is a classic example of bad manners.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:01.530
Eh?

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:05.220
It appears I need to also thoroughly drill some manners into you.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.200
Eh?!

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.470
I was just in a hurry this morning.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.730
I normally wear them pro-

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.900
Paprika Academy rule number 1315:

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:14.560
Crap!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.360
"Even if you normally do it properly,

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.980
it doesn't mean you can walk on the backstay just because you're in a rush"!

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.910
Now then, let us begin your Princess lessons.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.160
Okay.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:31.840
Capisce!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.340
Manaka-san!

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:34.000
Yes?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.450
You're not allowed to use "capisce" during Princess lessons.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:43.720
When responding, the two of you should use the proper "yes, ma'am".

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:44.770
Okay!

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:47.430
I said use "yes, ma'am"!

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:48.910
Ye...

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.970
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.420
Of course, ma'am.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:53.860
We'd be glad to.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.030
Yes, we'd be of course to.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.450
We'll yes, ma'am.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.830
We'll yes, we'd be ma'am, glad to.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.350
Quit screwing around!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.580
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:05.990
Good enough.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.090
We'll start with this.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.160
That's huge!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:13.770
As a Princess, you are expected to dance in high heels at a party.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.390
Yes, Ma'am.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.710
What's with you two?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.840
You must stand up straight and elegantly!

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.800
Yes, Ma'am.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.660
Stand up!

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:28.560
Now onto the tiara.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:33.810
Being able to stay composed and maintain a cool smile even when wearing a heavy tiara...

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:34.850
Heavy!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.220
...is a must for a Princess.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.200
Ye... Ye...

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.780
Yes, Ma'am.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:46.400
Now then, keep that posture as we start the lesson.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.110
Eh?!

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:53.910
A PriPara Princess must worry about fashion above all else.

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:59.580
As such, we'll be going over some PriPara Trivia concerning coords.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.420
Yes, Ma'am.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:05.140
This China Rock Coord has a certain animal attached to it.

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:06.510
What is that animal?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.920
Dressing Parfait wore that coord...

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:12.470
Let's see... what animal was it...?

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.060
Here's a hint: It's black and white.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.030
I got it! It's a German cow.

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:20.800
Let's see, black and white... black and white...

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.480
A penguin! Or zebra?

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.650
The Suffolk is a species of sheep that's also black and white.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.490
Those are all wrong!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:28.730
Next hint:

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:29.920
We're continuing?!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.580
It's a cute and popular animal.

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.490
Oh, I got it!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.590
A tapir!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.460
You hear cute and that's what you think!?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.040
It is! All animals are cute!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.020
We don't need that kind of thinking here!

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:45.100
This cute animal is...

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.690
And there it is!

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:48.120
A panda!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.050
P-P-Panda!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.620
Oh, that's right. A panda!

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.810
We don't have those in the Palps.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.650
You're tiring.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.470
But...!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.560
When it comes to table manners,

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:05.730
a Princess who can use chopsticks is considered elegant.

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:09.850
These chopstick corrective casts will whip you into shape.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:12.450
Torture? Isn't this torture?!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.910
But it looks so good...

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.540
We shall partake in this wonderful food.

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.460
You must have good posture while eating.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.210
Don't grasp your chopsticks!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.460
Don't hold them in your mouth!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.040
Don't bring the plate to your face!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.430
Don't lose your chopsticks!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.220
Even if food slips away, don't stab it!

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:33.970
Don't drop them!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.390
Don't eat like a dog!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:36.850
Pushuu~.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.680
Once you're done eating, put your chopsticks on the chopstick rest.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:40.810
Pushushuu~.

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:44.340
For crying out loud, you're a handful...

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:44.770
Huh?

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:46.940
Where's Midorikaze-san?!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.160
She must have ran off!

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.730
Ouch.

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.760
High heels sure are rough on the feet.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:03.160
Since I always ran around the mountains barefoot,

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.390
it'll take a while to get used to them.

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:09.660
Princess lessons are tougher than I expected.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:13.970
But everyone came to see me off.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.800
So I have to become a wonderful Princess.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.880
I wonder what they're all doing.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:24.100
I can't see the mountains or sky from here.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:28.310
I wonder if everyone's doing well.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.560
The young swallows in that nest,

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:33.000
I wonder if they've learned how to fly yet.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.790
The small squirrels in the forest and the rabbits in the grasslands,

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.720
I wonder what they're doing right about now.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:45.540
It's too soon to be homesick, Fuwari.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.750
Midorikaze-san!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.710
Where are you?!

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:51.670
It's Ookanda-sensei!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.260
Uh-oh.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:11.940
Are you unharmed?

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:15.190
P-Prince-sama?!

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.020
It's Hibiki-sama! How lucky!

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.240
I'm so jealous!
It's Hibiki-sama! How lucky!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.330
Okay, calm down.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.610
To fly down like a goddess...

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:25.460
Just what part of the heavens are you from?

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.140
I'm sorry.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:32.920
I thought I might be able to see the Palps if I climbed to the top of that tree.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.180
Homesick, huh?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:42.620
You are the one expected to win the Summer Dream Idol GranPrix and become the Dream Parade Princess,

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.980
in other words the ultimate Princess.

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:50.590
I knew you had the talent.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:55.780
I look forward to your growth.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.330
Hibiki-sama!

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.110
Of course!
Hibiki-sama!

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:58.490
Hibiki-sama is...!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.950
J-Just where did she go?!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:04.160
Did I go a bit overboard with the training?!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:04.820
Huh?

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.370
Sorry I'm late.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.180
I'll do my best with the Princess lessons!

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:12.090
Please be more strict with me, Sensei!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.110
Huh?

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.180
Um...

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.560
Proper response!

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.550
Y-Yes, Ma'am.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.030
Huh?

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:22.970
This song again!

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.240
Fuwari-chan, that's a phone.

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:26.890
Phone?

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.440
Press that and then say "hello".

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.250
H-Hello?
Hello! Hello!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.320
She finally answered-kuma!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.500
Geez! Toriko has become quite a handful! It's troublesome-kuma!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.980
After all, Toriko is unwanted-tori!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:44.410
I should set off to the mascot graveyard-tori!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.620
She completely lost her cool when you continually ignored her call.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.600
I wasn't ignoring her.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.430
I didn't know how to use a phone.

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:54.000
Tori?

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.390
I'm sorry I didn't think about it earlier, Toriko-san.

00:10:57.390 --> 00:11:01.890
Toriko-san is my very, very precious manager.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.330
Tori!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.440
Thank tori!

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.000
I wanted to tell you right away-tori!

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.400
Your new brand is finally done-tori!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.670
Bravo!
Hooray!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:15.440
It's finally time for my début concert!
It's finally time for your début concert!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.830
Cosmic hi!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.660
Fuwari-san, thank you for waiting.

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.390
Congratulations on the start of a new brand.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.300
New brand?

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:42.930
Here, try pulling on this ribbon.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.510
Ribbon?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:56.080
Coco Flower?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.300
That's right!

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.570
I used Fuwari-chan's image and created the new brand Coco Flower!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:08.380
It's a brand that focuses on using natural materials while adding a novel arrangement to a cute country motif.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:11.830
It has completely revolutionized the PriPara Fashion world!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.080
Wow!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.380
So cool!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:19.840
And with that, CoCo Flower has opened a new store in PriPara!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.010
Wow!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.300
How wonderful!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.770
Here's a PriTicket for the Tyrolean Fleur Coord.

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:28.120
I'm sorry it took so long.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:30.270
Now go put everything you've got into your PriPara Change!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.080
Thank you so much!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.870
PriPara Change!

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.390
Complete!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.840
It looks great on you!

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.560
You're super cute, Fuwari!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.840
How lucky! I want a new brand, too!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:12.880
Toriko-san.

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:13.990
That coord...

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:16.260
That coord looks perfect on you!

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:17.230
Thanks.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:23.590
Mega-niisan should be sending you your debut song "This Song Tomareihi" soon.

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:24.820
And here it is!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.680
Wow!

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:35.500
It's like your Birthday and Christmas presents have been rolled into one-tori!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.170
Ah!

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:38.460
I'm sure after all this happiness something unfortunate will...

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:42.630
An assortment of Friday the 13th, your most unlucky day, and the armageddon will come-tori!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.080
Lord have mercy on us. Please lord...

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.390
Don't worry. Calm down.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:49.390
Mikan will take pudding and curry udon-nano!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.810
Welcome!

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.580
To celebrate the opening of Coco Flower,

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.620
we will be selling pudding a la mode for a limited time!

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.380
Coco Flower?

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.610
What's that-nano?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:04.820
It's a new brand created from Midorikaze Fuwari-san's image.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.920
Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 259, section 5151:

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:12.110
"When the ultimate Princess appears,

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:15.050
the demon's grand power shall be demonstrated."

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.380
Fuwari, the one who currently basks in everyone's attention,

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:22.040
I shall do whatever it takes to draw thee into Alomagedon!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:26.920
Then, Mikan will take 25 of those limited Coco Flower parfaits!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:27.550
Hold on!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:28.010
Gel?
Hold on!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:31.930
I'm reluctant to part with the final note in my purse.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.970
She's broke-nano.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:37.360
Good luck with your début concert!

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.860
Make sure to put everything into your challenge.

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:40.180
Tension max!

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.190
Relax!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.840
Look, Fuwari,

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:47.650
it's best to sing like you're trying to convey your feelings to someone.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:50.780
If you do that, you can put more energy into it.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:55.290
Convey my feelings... to someone...?

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.650
No! No! No!

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:04.170
I absolutely won't let you enter-tori!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.570
Think about it-tori.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:06.970
If you decide to do your début concert now,

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.580
things like make a misstep,

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.690
forget the lyrics,

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.180
accidentally drop the microphone,

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.810
and having the set fall down like a comedy skit are bound to happen-tori!

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.480
If that happens, there will be a storm of boos from the crowd.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.580
You'll be heckled, eggs will be thrown, people will talk about you behind your back,

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.740
and you'll absolutely, completely, and undoubtedly regret it!

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.360
You sure are a noisy manager!

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.530
If you're too cowardly people will call you a chicken!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.780
I am a chicken-tori!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.880
You should just prepare an absolutely delicious meal of deep fried Toriko and vegetables...

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:34.530
...garnished with a potato and carrot glaze topped with tarter sauce-tori!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.490
It'll be delicious-tori!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.670
Y-You're super annoying!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.890
Here, Fuwari.

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.670
Take this Cyalume Charm.

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:43.440
Thanks.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.380
Hey, stop-pri.
Thanks.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:45.880
No, don't do it-tori.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:50.250
Toriko! You need to properly put in her entry-pri!

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:56.720
But it's been so long since Toriko has entered anyone she forgot how-tori!

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:58.010
Um...

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.740
Entry...

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.260
It's not possible-tori.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:03.900
Of course it's impossible-tori.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.780
Your entry has been accepted.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:06.940
The leaf isn't needed.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:07.440
Eh?!

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.830
Thanks.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.030
Fuwari...

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:14.420
I'll be right back.

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.760
It'll be fine, Toriko-san.

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:18.990
I'll make it a complete success.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.320
Cheer for me!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.550
Good luck with your first concert!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.580
Fuwari!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.210
Go for it, Fuwari-chan!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:36.090
Congrats on your début!

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.560
Do your best!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.910
You should do it more like that.

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.010
And go!

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:45.420
Take this!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:46.230
Cut!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.250
Making Drama Switch On!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:55.260
Let's go!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:13.280
A mysterious spring orchestra!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:17.280
Cyalume Change!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.690
That was the best "Yes, ma'am"!

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:54.670
Thank you!

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.480
Well, that wasn't too bad for her début.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:07.830
Ah, Shikyouin-san's up, but I guess he's not ready yet..

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.840
The green glow indicates a natural type.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.840
This is also the first time I've seen this colour.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.970
She has also jumped up the rankings!

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.840
She made it all the way to Newbie Idol in one go!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.600
Good job!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.130
You blew it out of the park!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:33.570
That concert was just like you-pri!

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:37.320
You have a voice that makes me feel like a child again.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.820
Thanks!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:43.120
I tried to show off the feelings of the Palps, my beloved home.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.730
I was nervous, but I had a lot of fun!

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:46.950
I want to do it again!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.830
Pri!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:48.800
Yeah, let's do it!

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:52.180
Join SoLaMi Smile and aim to win the Summer Dream GranPrix with us!

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:53.920
Huh? What are you saying?

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:57.310
Fuwari is joining Dressing Parfait, right?

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.420
Right?

00:19:58.420 --> 00:19:59.800
SoLaMi Smile!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.170
Dressing Parfait!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.010
SoLaMi!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:02.610
Dressing!

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:03.090
SoLa!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:03.410
Dres!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:03.840
SoLa!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.220
Dres!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:04.590
SoLa!

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:04.970
Dres!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:05.300
SoLa!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:08.520
The team Fuwari will join,

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.820
Huh?

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:13.680
Toriko thinks it should be decided by her manager.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.350
Tori?!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.650
Yes?

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.570
H-Hibiki-sama!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.130
I watched Fuwari's concert.

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:27.700
Thank you for guiding her, Miss Gloria.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.290
No, no, no! I did nothing!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:36.130
However, let's change the song's Making Drama for her next concert.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:39.180
Please make sure she's ready by the GranPrix.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.190
This purple goat is...

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.240
A letter?

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.150
<i>Congragulations on your debut concert.</i>

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:11.920
<i>Since you're a bit homesick,</i>

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:14.710
<i>I'll give you this Royal Imperial.</i>

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:18.460
<i>Truly yours, Hibiki.</i>

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.830
Prince-sama,

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:30.390
I'll make sure to become an elegant Princess.

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:32.740
Please wait for me.

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:08.190
Why?! Why?! Why?!

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:10.860
What do you mean we're prohibited from doing PriPara?

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:13.330
What? I didn't hear anything about this?

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:15.040
Ack! Principal Ookanda!

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:16.800
How delightful!

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:18.410
She's after us!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.920
This is the same as a year ago!

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.330
We won't give up!

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:24.640
Well go to PriPara and perform no matter what!

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:25.380
Let's go, Lala!

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:26.450
Capisce!

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:28.990
PriPara is for everyone!

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:29.780
Next time:

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:32.020
PriPara Has Been Outlawed!

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:33.350
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:34.760
Let's go PriPara!
